@startuml
title 配置解析、聚合与动态覆盖

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #1E40AF
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantFontColor #172554
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

participant "Dubbo XML" as XML
participant "DubboBeanDefinitionParser" as Parser
participant "ReferenceConfig / ServiceConfig" as Config
participant "AbstractConfig" as AbstractConfig
participant "URL 参数 Map" as Params
participant "RegistryDirectory" as Directory
participant "Configurator" as Override
participant "合并后的 URL" as URL
participant "调用方" as Caller

XML -> Parser: parse(element)
Parser -> Config: 设置 Consumer / Provider /\nReference / Service / MethodConfig
Config -> AbstractConfig: appendProperties(config)
AbstractConfig -> Config: -D 系统属性覆盖 Bean 属性
Config -> Params: appendParameters(application)
Config -> Params: appendParameters(module)
Config -> Params: appendParameters(consumer/provider default)
Config -> Params: appendParameters(reference/service)
Config -> Params: appendParameters(method, methodName)

Directory -> Directory: mergeUrl(providerUrl)
Directory -> Params: ClusterUtils.mergeUrl(provider, consumer)
Directory -> Override: configure(mergedUrl)
Override --> Directory: 动态覆盖后的 URL
Directory -> URL: 保存最终参数
Caller -> URL: getMethodParameter(method, key)
URL -> URL: 先查 method.key，再查 key
URL --> Caller: 最终配置值
@enduml
